[
  {
    "id": "first-visit-01",
    "trigger": "first-visit",
    "text": "你好，我叫长毛，是一只长毛小狸花。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 0,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "tab-return-01",
    "trigger": "tab-return",
    "text": "刚刚去忙了吗？",
    "mood": "curious",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "tab-return-02",
    "trigger": "tab-return",
    "text": "很高兴再见到你。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "toy-start-01",
    "trigger": "toy-start",
    "text": "这次一定抓得到。",
    "mood": "playful",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 15000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "toy-end-01",
    "trigger": "toy-end",
    "text": "差一点就抓到了。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 15000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "pet-head-01",
    "trigger": "pet-head",
    "text": "这里可以再摸一下。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 8000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "pet-head-02",
    "trigger": "pet-head",
    "text": "嗯，感觉很安心。",
    "mood": "relaxed",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 8000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "pet-head-03",
    "trigger": "pet-head",
    "text": "你的手心很温柔。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 8000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "rapid-click-01",
    "trigger": "rapid-click",
    "text": "再摸我就哈气啦！",
    "mood": "annoyed",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 15000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-01",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "有两样东西，我们愈经常愈持久地加以沉思，它们就越使心灵充满日久弥新、有增无减的惊奇和敬畏：我头顶上的星空和我心中的道德律。",
    "mood": "curious",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-02",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "认识你自己，是一切智慧的开始。",
    "mood": "curious",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-03",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "我们不是为了抵达终点而旅行，而是在旅途中成为自己。",
    "mood": "relaxed",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-04",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "不要害怕走得慢，只要不要停下脚步。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-05",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "昨天的自己无法改变，但今天的自己可以选择方向。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-06",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "种一棵树最好的时间是十年前，其次是现在。",
    "mood": "relaxed",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-07",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "每一次努力，都在塑造未来的自己。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-08",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "一个人只有在独处时，才能真正听见自己的声音。",
    "mood": "relaxed",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-09",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "孤独不是没有陪伴，而是没有与自己相处的能力。",
    "mood": "relaxed",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-10",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "内心丰盈的人，即使独处，也拥有整个世界。",
    "mood": "relaxed",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-11",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "安静下来，才能听见生命真正想告诉你的事情。",
    "mood": "relaxed",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-12",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "不要害怕黑夜，因为星光只在黑暗中显现。",
    "mood": "curious",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-13",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "仰望星空的人，也应该脚踏实地。",
    "mood": "curious",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-14",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "我们都是宇宙中短暂出现的奇迹。",
    "mood": "curious",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-15",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "宇宙浩瀚，而我们仍然愿意追问。",
    "mood": "curious",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-16",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "保持好奇，是对世界最大的尊重。",
    "mood": "curious",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-17",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "今天也辛苦啦，记得给自己一点温柔。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-18",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "别急呀，小猫陪你慢慢走。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-19",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "世界很大，但此刻这一刻，也值得被珍惜。",
    "mood": "relaxed",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-20",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "如果觉得迷茫，就先休息一下，再继续寻找方向。",
    "mood": "relaxed",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-21",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "愿你永远保持好奇，像第一次看见世界的小猫一样。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-22",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "小猫想知道：如果没有人看见花开，花还会不会美丽？",
    "mood": "curious",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-23",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "宇宙这么大，能遇见此刻的你，也是一件很神奇的事。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-24",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "星星不知道自己有多亮，但它依然照亮夜晚。",
    "mood": "curious",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-25",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "人生像猫咪散步，不一定有目的地，但每一步都有意义。",
    "mood": "playful",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-26",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "世界不会总给答案，但会给愿意思考的人更多风景。",
    "mood": "curious",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-27",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "小猫觉得，思考本身就是一种浪漫。",
    "mood": "curious",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-28",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "我们都是时间里的小小旅人，要认真看看沿途。",
    "mood": "relaxed",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-29",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "生命很短，所以喜欢的事情要早点去做。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-30",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "如果人生是一场旅行，小猫希望你不要忘记欣赏风景。",
    "mood": "happy",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  },
  {
    "id": "idle-31",
    "trigger": "idle",
    "text": "真正重要的东西，往往需要安静下来才能发现。",
    "mood": "relaxed",
    "weight": 1,
    "minIntervalMs": 60000,
    "paths": ["*"]
  }
]
